  "title": "Rock/Zoltan intervention",
  "extracted_from": "raw/gamedata/events_rock.xml",
  "text": {
    "value": "It seems a Zoltan ship came here to liberate a Rock settlement from their 'oppressive belief system', and that the settlement did not appreciate it - long-range scanners suggest the Zoltan and their pursuers will be here at any moment!",
    "ref": "event_ROCK_ZOLTAN_HELP_text"
  },
