      {
        "label": "Stay and defend the Zoltan.",
        "gate": null,
        "child": {
          "text": {
            "value": "The... extreme nature of Rock faith is well-known; the Zoltan can hardly be blamed for trying to broaden their horizons. The pursuing Rock ship quickly assesses the situation and decides two captured alien ships are better than one.",
